          "text": "[Request from the team regarding In Falsus Spoilers]\n\nIn Falsus features a full-length Visual Novel Scenario with twists, turns, joy, sadness, and surprises.\n\nAs the Scenario is core to In Falsus, when posting and sharing contents please bear in mind that many people may still be experiencing the game for the first time, unaware of what lies within, and sharing late-game contents on hashtags they may explore will spoil their experience.\n\nWe have set out a guideline that we request players abide by below:\nhttps://t.co/5dk8ddU6uM\n\nThe most important point clarifies that contents regarding Arc 3's ending and beyond is deemed a spoiler.\n\nFor the experience of new players, we request that spoilers be clearly marked or hidden beforehand when posting.\n\nPlease use the hashtag #infalsus_spoiler for any spoilers, and do not use #infalsus when posting these spoilers.\n\nThe final decision ultimately rests with your good judgement, and we hope that you will use spoiler tags in good faith to those newly stepping into the game, no matter at what pace."
        },
